  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Selle allika antud link vastas HTTP {status}. See võis aeguda — otsi allikatest uuesti värsket.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Lingile, mille see allikas andis, ei õnnestunud ligi pääseda.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Pilt, mis on praegu rakenduse taga",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Mängija ala ei saanudki suurust, seega esitust ei alustatud.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Mängija ise — dekodeerimine, subtiitrid ja heli. GPLv2 või uuem.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Projekt ei majuta, ei halda, ei toeta ega soovita ühtegi allikat ega levita nende loendit.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Projekt GitHubis",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "See väljalase ei sisalda uuendust sellele platvormile.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Allikas on selle juba hankinud — mängib kohe ega jäta sellesse seadmesse midagi",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Toetajate nimekirja ei õnnestunud laadida — ülal olev Ko-fi leht sisaldab praegust.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Torrentimootor võttis magneti vastu, kuid ei andnud sellele ID-d.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Torrentimootor, rakendusse sisse ehitatud. MIT-litsentsiga.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Torrentivoog pole veel valmis (mootor vastas HTTP {status}). Võib-olla laadib ta ikka veel partneritelt metaandmeid.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Uuendust ei õnnestunud paigaldada: {error}",
  "Theme": "Teema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Siin jagub ruumi vaevu ühele filmile. Ühenda karbi külge USB-ketas — FAT32-ks vormindatud, mida iga Androidi karp aktsepteerib — ja see ilmub üles, et sellele hoopis alla laadida.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Pole kontot, kuhu sisse logida, ega midagi, mis serverisse sünkrooniks. Mida sa vaatad, kui kaugele oled jõudnud, sinu lemmikud ja vaatamisnimekiri on kõik salvestatud sellesse seadmesse ega lahku sellest kunagi. Ekraanidevaheline sünkroonimine on plaanis; seni on allolev varukoopia see, kuidas kogu liigub.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Sinu dokumentide kaustas pole ühtegi {file}. Kopeeri üks sinna ja proovi uuesti.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "See ühendus on praegu mahupõhine.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "See ühendus pole praegu mahupõhine.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Seda koopiat ei paigaldanud Venticu enda paigaldaja — vaid paketihaldur või ehitus lähtekoodist — seega uuendab seda see, mis selle sinna pani. Failide asendamine siit ainult segaks teda.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Selle seadme dekooder andis failiga alla. Tavaliselt on süüdi heli: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) ja DTS pole süsteemi veebivaates litsentsitud, nii et sellise heliga väljalase mängib pildina ilma helita või üldse mitte. AAC-heliga x264 väljalase mängib.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Sellel failil on üks heliriba.",
